   "source": [
    "So the more promiscuous [4] version (20 bands per fingerprint) finds many more candidate pairs than the conservative 2 bands model. The first implication of this difference is that it leads to you having to do more comparisons to find the real duplicates. Let's see what that looks like in practice.\n",
    "\n",
    "We'll slightly modify the `candidate_duplicates` function so that it stores the line number along with the document ID, that way we can retrieve to document contents easier later on."
   ]
  },
